      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "The value of control\nMoritz Reis, Roland Pfister, Katharina A. Schwarz\n\nNote: The innate feeling of needing to be in control of outcome in human psychology is the root of most trading pain & desire for discretion in trading.\n\n**This paper shows that perceived control is a powerful motivator and people will often give up benefits to feel in control, even if it's less rewarding financially.**",
      "author": {
        "id": "231881969250598913",
        "name": "sentienttradingsociety",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "SentientRon",
        "color": "#0088FF",
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [
