      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "***Do Individual Day Traders Make Money?\nEvidence from Taiwan***\n\nThere is a paper that I like to refer to often; that has some eye-opening insights for new traders; specifically about the number of profitable day traders (reality) vs (reported): the final number IIRC is around 0.3% make better than minimum wage after 2y.\n\nI don' know if it's peer-reviewed; as it's not citing references and it's multi-disciplinary - \nHowever it does appear to be a serious paper, on the Berkeley paper/release website; so it's as good as any and better than most (in terms of probably legit)\n\nhttps://faculty.haas.berkeley.edu/odean/papers/Day%20Traders/Day%20Trade%20040330.pdf",
      "author": {
        "id": "188217239525130250",
        "name": "hotmatrixx",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "hotmatrixx",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/188217239525130250/1edbd9e142f144dc5d1abdaac4015a0d.png?size=512"
      },
