      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "A theory of intraday patterns: volume and price variability was published in The Review of Financial Studies in 1988\n\nPreviously cited in #⚜️︱education \nThe understanding of session opens, closes and the shocks they produce are used in conjunction with the insights the Federal Reserve's values provide for electronic markets.\nThe principles remain the same.\n\n #⚜️︱education I will soon produce figures to process and simplify the information without losing its signal. The benefit its understanding provides are more optimal hours.",
